warning
# Issue #2666: the wedged-aggregate self-heal lane could not re-run a timed-out required job
# (GitHub refused the rerun call; stage "rerun") or a whole tick failed (stage "pass", e.g. an
# unreadable open-PR list). Warning, not error: a refused rerun is retried a bounded number of
# times and a failed tick re-arms its cadence; the stuck PR still surfaces through
# mergequeue_stalled.
